12
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:59,039
Hist. Did you hear that noise, Kabako?

13
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:04,717
Take the bucket, will you, Archie? What noise do you mean? There it is again,

14
00:01:04,718 --> 00:01:11,519
under the hatches. Don't you hear it? A cough. It sounded like a cough. Cough be

15
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:15,118
